<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Q1 unit down.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Q1 unit down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter</p>
<p>				    1997	   1996</p>
<p>		 (In thousands, except per unit amounts)</p>
<p>     Revenues	    $  211,770   $  256,661</p>
<p>     Operating income	38,108	 71,461</p>
<p>     Net income		29,232	 62,661</p>
<p>     Net income per unit	.28	    .61</p>
<p>Average units</p>
<p>	  outstanding	 103,466	103,466</p>
<p>NOTE: figures include a net charge of $3.3 million ($0.03 per unit) for the 1997 period and a net gain of $6.9 million ($0.07 per unit) for the 1996 period.</p>
